[00:00.000] 作词 : NORIO JOSEPH AONO/LISA GOMAMOTO
[00:00.000] 作曲 : やまだ豊
[00:00.000]作曲 : やまだ豊
[00:01.000]作词 : NORIO JOSEPH AONO/LISA GOMAMOTO
[00:11.90]I have done so far, but beneath my soul
[00:11.90]已经走了这么远，但在我灵魂深处
[00:20.92]I know I could have gone with you
[00:20.92]知道我能与你并肩而行
[00:26.08]Sing a song awhile and I'll be calm again
[00:26.08]唱一首歌，稍作调整，我就能恢复平静
[00:33.79]When I'm feeling down, I would count the stars
[00:33.79]沮丧时，我能数一颗颗星辰
[00:42.70]Up above all I see is you, dream of you
[00:42.70]在那星海中我看见的是你，梦中的你
[00:50.73]Someday you'll come back?
[00:50.73]会有你回来的那一天吧？
[00:56.45]Raindrops fall down on me so cold but so tenderly
[00:56.45]雨滴落在我身上，如此冰冷却带着温柔
[01:06.08]Could we put hearts together though we're far so apart?
[01:06.08]纵然身隔千里，但我们的心是一起的吧？
[01:16.47]Do you think of me? Care for me? I get so alone...alone
[01:16.47]你想我吗？挂念我吗？此时的我非常孤独
[01:27.32]Traffic light the crossing crowd
[01:27.32]交叉灯路口人群熙熙攘攘
[01:32.43]How could I live my life without you?
[01:32.43]没有你的生活该怎么过？
[02:01.90]In the morning sun when I look around
[02:01.90]每个晨曦下我环顾四周
[02:10.52]All I feel is the pain inside
[02:10.52]能感受到的只有痛楚
[02:16.05]Another story of a broken hearted soul
[02:16.05]灵魂破碎彼方的故事
[02:23.36]Time will slip away leaving pieces of
[02:23.36]被时间偷走的是
[02:32.32]Little moments I've been with you, shared with you
[02:32.32]那些我与你在一起分享快乐的片段
[02:40.28]Someday I'll move on?
[02:40.28]会有我继续前进的那一天吧？
[02:45.40]Raindrops fall down on me so cold but so gently
[02:45.40]雨滴落在我身上，如此冰冷却带着温柔
[02:55.78]Would we put hearts together though we're far so apart?
[02:55.78]纵然身隔千里，但我们的心是一起的吧？
[03:06.48]Will you think of me? Search for me? I'll be so alone...alone
[03:06.48]你想我吗？挂念我吗？此时的我非常孤独
[03:17.27]Traffic light the crossing crowd
[03:17.27]交叉灯路口人群熙熙攘攘
[03:22.55]How will I live my life without you?
[03:22.55]没有你我的生活该如何继续
